To run BBSGuard with everything enabled you would use the following:

   BBSGuard -g -l -n -v -s##### -d## -r##

The -s##### should be replaced with something like -s10800. This
will tell BBSGuard the maximum online time for a user is 10800
seconds (3 hours). -d## is the time from turning the computer on
to when the BBS is ready to answer the phone, in seconds. -r is
the maximum number of rings plus one that will occur when the BBS
is running properly
